  <div class="con-box">
    <p class="h4-tit01">Using Public Transportation</p>
    <div class="con-box02">
      <p class="h5-tit01">By subway</p>
      <div class="box-wrap col2">
        <div class="border-box box1">
          <p><span>Line 1</span></p>
          <div>
            <p class="box-tit">Get off at <span class="str">Yeokgok Station on Subway Line 1 Exit 2</span><br><span class="min">(10-minute walk to school)</span></p>
            <p class="box-tit">Get off at <span class="str">Yeokgok Station on Subway Line 1 Exit 3</span><br><span class="min">(10 minute walk to the back entrance of the school)</span></p>
            <ul class="ul-type-dot">
              <li>Incheon Station &harr; Yeokgok Station : 35 minutes</li>
              <li>Seoul Station &harr; Yeokgok Station : 30 minutes</li>
              <li>Sindorim Station &harr; Yeokgok Station : 15 minutes</li>
              <li>Bupyeong Station &harr; Yeokgok Station : 15 minutes</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-box box2">
          <p><span>Seohae Line</span></p>
          <div>
            <p class="box-tit">Get off at <span class="str">Sosa Station on the Seohae Line Exit 7</span><br><span class="min">(10 minute walk to the back entrance of the school)</span></p>
            <ul class="ul-type-dot">
              <li>Ilsan Station &harr; Sosa Station : 35mins</li>
              <li>Gimpo Airport Station &harr; Sosa Station : 11minutes</li>
              <li>Wonsi Station &harr; Sosa Station: 35 minutes</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="con-box02 no-pd">
      <p class="h5-tit01">By bus</p>
      <div class="box-wrap col2">
        <div class="border-box box3">
          <p><span>local<br>bus</span></p>
          <div>
            <p class="box-tit">If you take bus number 51, 51-1, or 51-2</p>
            <ul class="ul-type-dot">
              <li>Get off at [The Catholic University of Korea, Yeokgok Library] bus stop.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-box box4 bus">
          <p><span>city bus</span></p>
          <div>
            <div>
              <p class="box-tit">If you take bus number 20</p>
              <ul class="ul-type-dot">
                <li>Get off at [The Catholic University of Korea, Yeokgok Library] bus stop.</li>
              </ul>
              <ul>
                <li><br></li>
              </ul>
              <p class="box-tit">If you take buses number 5, 12, or 52</p>
              <ul class="ul-type-dot">
                <li>
                  <dl class="dl_desc">
                    <dt>Based on the main entrance :</dt>
                    <dd>Get off at [Yeokgok 2-dong Community Welfare Center Entrance] or [The Catholic University of Korea Entrance, Boram Shium Apartment] bus stop.</dd>
                  </dl>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <dl class="dl_desc">
                    <dt>Based on the rear gate :</dt>
                    <dd>Get off at [Geumgang Mansion] bus stop.</dd>
                  </dl>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="con-box">
    <p class="h4-tit01">Parking pass information</p>
    <div class="con-box02">
      <p class="h5-tit01">Passes</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <colgroup>
            <col>
            <col>
            <col>
          </colgroup>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Target</th>
              <th>Fees</th>
              <th>Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="txt-center">University personnel, faculty members (full-time), CUK students (Both Undergraduate and Graduate)</td>
              <td class="txt-center">KRW 10,000 / month<br>KRW 50,000 / Semester<br>KRW 100,000 / Year</td>
              <td class="txt-center" rowspan="2">Non-regular ticket : 2,000 won/day</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="txt-center">Part-time instructor</td>
              <td class="txt-center bd-r">KRW 10,000 / month<br>KRW 25,000 / Semester</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="txt-center">Leased stores, vendor facilities, construction, delivery, and business vehicles</td>
              <td class="txt-center">KRW 20,000 / month<br>KRW 100,000 / Semester<br>KRW 200,000 / Year</td>
              <td class="txt-center">Non-regular ticket less than 2H : 1,000 won<br>More than 2H ~ Less than 4H : 2,000 won<br>More than 4H ~ Less than 8H : 4,000 won<br>More than 8H : 10,000won</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="con-box02 no-pd">
        <p class="h6-tit01"><br></p>
        <p class="h6-tit01">Documents to prepare for issuing a commuter pass</p>
        <ul class="ul-type-dot">
          <li>ID, 1 copy of the application form (available at the Parking Management Office), and 1 copy of the vehicle registration (if the vehicle belongs to someone else, attach 1 copy of the relationship document)</li>
          <li>Exemption from parking pass fees upon submission of a disability certificate (Only for University personnel, Faculty members, and students themselves)</li>
          <li>10% discount when paying annually for a commuter pass</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="con-box02">
      <p class="h5-tit01">Discount Tickets</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <colgroup>
            <col>
            <col>
            <col>
          </colgroup>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Target</th>
              <th>Fees</th>
              <th>Notes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="txt-center">School Continuing Education, Career Support Team, International Affairs Team, Student Guidance &amp; Counseling Center</td>
              <td class="txt-center">KRW 1,000 / Day</td>
              <td class="txt-center" rowspan="3">Purchasing Discount Tickets<br>(Parking Management Office)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="txt-center">Office of Admissions</td>
              <td class="txt-center bd-r">KRW 2,000 / Day</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="txt-center">Conferences, seminars, events, and wedding guests</td>
              <td class="txt-center bd-r">Less than 2H : 1,000 won<br>More than 2H ~ Less than 4H : 2,000 won<br>More than 4H ~ Less than 8H : 4,000 won<br>More than 8H : 10,000 won</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
